## Model card

- **Name:** Nemotron 3.5 Super VL (NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Super-VL-120B-A12B)
- **Short description:** NVIDIA's open-weight multimodal Nemotron model (released 2026-10-15) for visual reasoning and agentic AI workflows — a 120B-total / 12B-active MoE with a 1M context.
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter (`nvidia/nemotron-3.5-super-vl`), W&B (`nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Super-VL-120B-A12B`), DigitalOcean, plus ~3 routes.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-10-15; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `nemotron-3.5-super-vl`, `nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Super-VL-120B-A12B`, `nvidia/nemotron-3.5-super-vl`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens; max output 943,718 (OpenRouter).
- **Modalities:** text, image and video in; text out; reasoning and tool calls.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** $0.15 / $0.47 per 1M input/output; cache read $0.02 (DigitalOcean $0.30/$0.65).
- **Architecture:** open-weight MoE, 120B total / 12B active (NVIDIA); weights published.

