## Search notes (why self-excluded)

- BenchLM has no profile: `benchlm.ai/models/nemotron-3-5-super-vl` returns HTTP 404.
- models.dev carries the model (release 2026-10-15, 1M context, $0.15/$0.47, text/image/video in) but no benchmark fields.
- No vendor blog or NVIDIA technical report with a benchmark table was reachable for this SKU within this pass; the sibling `nemotron-3.5-bolt-*` and `nemotron-3-nano-omni` entries carry their own numbers and were deliberately not transferred (different checkpoints).
- Resolution: spec facts above are catalog-verified; the benchmark columns stay empty until NVIDIA publishes a Super VL scorecard.

